  tutorialText: {fileID: 1955251942}
  nextButton: {fileID: 739244369}
  targetCanvas: {fileID: 840441130}
  messages:
  - Welcome. To begin, please bend your left wrist toward your face to view the task
    list. Press OK once you figure it out.
  - These are your tasks to complete. Objects in your task list will glow bright
    red. Complete these tasks to build a rocket and escape. Click OK to learn how
    to collect objects.
  - Most tasks will require you to collect items by grabbing them and moving them
    towards your head. One of those objects is in this very room. Collect it.
  - Be careful about the monster roaming around. Try to hide your body behind various
    objects like benches, pots, or chairs to evade its line of sight. Don't get caught.
  - This room will be your only safe zone. Press OK to open up this room. Good luck.
  walls:
  - {fileID: 541151232}
  - {fileID: 1475706821}
  slideDuration: 2
